    {
      "text": "Satan tells men to deceive, D&C 10:25. wo unto him who lies to deceive, D&C 10:28. Saints should not receive those who come with revelations, so that they may not be deceived, D&C 43:6. they who take the Holy Spirit for guide and have not been deceived shall abide the Lord’s coming, D&C 45:57. that ye may not be deceived, seek best gifts, D&C 46:8. Satan seeks to deceive, D&C 50:3. wo unto them that are deceivers and hypocrites, D&C 50:6. the Lord gives pattern that Saints may not be deceived, D&C 52:14. many are blinded by those who lie in wait to deceive, D&C 123:12. contrary to order of heaven for just man to deceive, D&C 129:7.",
